## Where things live

The repo has **four layers**, ordered from slowest-changing to fastest. Read this
table before you add or move a file.

| Directory | Layer | What goes here | Edit by hand? |
|-----------|-------|----------------|:-------------:|
| `src/{{ package_name }}/` | **Library** | Pure, typed, tested functions. No I/O, no analysis scripts. | ✅ (with tests) |
| `workflow/` | **Pipeline** | Snakemake rules + thin entrypoints that wire `src/` to configs. No business logic. | ✅ |
| `conf/` | Config | Hydra tree (all parameters, no magic numbers) + `conf/theme/` (colors/fonts). | ✅ |
| `data/raw/` | **Data (in)** | Raw measurements. **Immutable, read-only.** Tracked by {{ data_versioning }}, not git. | ⛔ never |
| `data/interim`, `data/processed` | Data | Regenerable pipeline intermediates. | ⛔ (regenerated) |
| `metadata/` | Data | Pydantic-validated schemas: sample_id → condition → file. | ✅ |
| `assets/figures/` | **Figures (in)** | **Authored** figures: schematics, BioRender/Illustrator/SVG source. Git-tracked. | ✅ |
| `results/figures/` | **Figures (out)** | **Generated** figures from the pipeline (`light/` + `dark/`). Gitignored. | ⛔ never |
| `results/tables/` | Results | Generated tables. Gitignored. | ⛔ (regenerated) |
| `reporting/` | **Reporting** | Papers, posters, slides, writeups. Reference figures, don't copy them. | ✅ |
| `exploratory/` | — | **Scratch** notebooks — disposable, unlinted, nothing load-bearing. | ✅ (throwaway) |
| `docs/` | — | Docs site + an **executed** narrative tutorial (kept true on every build). | ✅ |
| `lab/` | — | Protocols, sample manifests. Human/ELN territory. | ✅ (humans) |
| `tests/` | — | Unit/property tests. | ✅ |

