## Reproducing a specific result

Every figure/table is a named pipeline target:

```bash
{% if include_example %}snakemake results/figures/light/example_group_means.pdf   # rebuild one figure
{% else %}# once you've added figure rules, target them by output path, e.g.:
# snakemake results/figures/light/fig3.pdf
{% endif %}snakemake --list                                # see all targets
```

Full environment-up reproduction, including data and container details, is in
[`REPRODUCE.md`](REPRODUCE.md).

